[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3005213819","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107568#issuecomment-3005213819","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107568","id":3005213819,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zH-x7","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-25T15:31:07Z","updated_at":"2025-06-25T15:31:07Z","body":"I wonder why the length isn't just clamped? I mean, the max is already enforced:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/30456ba095c425d5ecde320a96a763afb93bbcb0/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/particles_storage.cpp#L443","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3005213819/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016934144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107568#issuecomment-3016934144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107568","id":3016934144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6z0sMA","user":{"login":"Rudolph-B","id":52322745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52322745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Rudolph-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-29T18:06:39Z","updated_at":"2025-06-29T19:03:42Z","body":"If we just clamp the minimum value to `0.01` without emitting any errors, a user might try to \"disable\" trails by setting the length to zero. In this case, trails would still appear, which would be unwanted behavior.\r\n\r\nI think we are in this scenario because it seems activating particle trails comes with some performance cost. It would then be preferred that when the user doesn't want the effect anymore, it should rather be properly deactivated than to just set the trail length to `0`.\r\n\r\nI think the max is also enforced due to a performance related issue. Arguable it should probably emit a warning? ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016934144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github